You defeated him. I’ll make sure to pay you as soon as I can. #speaker: Ryker #portrait: ryker #layout: right #trigger: player
Don’t worry about it. #speaker: Ace #portrait: ace #layout: left
You betrayed me. I picked you for that bounty because you’re supposed to be heartless. #speaker: Talon #portrait: talon #layout: right
Well people can surprise you. #speaker: Ace #portrait: ace #layout: left
They sure can. I even have one surprise for you. #speaker: Talon #portrait: talon #layout: right
What? #speaker: Ace #portrait: ace #layout: left
I have put up the largest bounty on you that has ever been seen. #speaker: Talon #portrait: talon #layout: right
Your life is going to be hell from this point forward.
Goodbye Talon. #speaker: Ace #portrait: ace #layout: left
#scene: lobby